WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-09 - Paired Devices
NOTE Artist: Crimson Node
NOTE Album: 2002: Crimson Node

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.200
[Instrumental Intro: Three Echoing Drum Hits & Bittersweet Synth-Pop Groove]

00:00:16.596 --> 00:00:20.200
I walk into the server, the music's playing loud

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:25.665
There's a hundred perfect connections standing in the crowd

00:00:26.205 --> 00:00:28.988
Every port is taken, every signal's strong

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:32.000
Everybody's got a partner to help them sing along

00:00:32.291 --> 00:00:35.200
I see them sharing bandwidth, laughing in the light

00:00:35.413 --> 00:00:38.236
While I am just a ghost out walking in the night

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:42.800
And the UI looks so happy.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.200
The rhythm feels so right.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:49.500
I'm smiling for the cameras under the neon light.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.000
But underneath the surface, where nobody can see

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:58.151
My receiver's flashing empty, and there's nothing left for me.

00:00:59.752 --> 00:01:03.114
Oh, all the other devices are perfectly paired!

00:01:03.154 --> 00:01:08.500
They've got a secure connection and a life to be shared!

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:14.800
While I'm just standing here alone and pouring a drink!

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Yeah, the network is crowded, the servers are full

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:23.200
But my anchor is gone, and I'm losing the pull!

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:28.500
Everybody's dancing, having the time of their life

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:33.832
While I am just smiling right through the knife!

00:01:37.273 --> 00:01:41.000
I see them walking by me, hand in hand they go

00:01:41.137 --> 00:01:44.280
A synchronized routine that I will never know

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:48.500
Player Two is busy, the phalanx is at rest

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:52.267
And I am just pretending that I am doing my best

00:01:52.347 --> 00:01:57.500
I tap my foot to the drumbeat, I nod my head to the sound

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:04.500
While my internal architecture burns to the ground!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.800
And the UI looks so happy.

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:10.500
The rhythm feels so right.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.500
I'm smiling for the cameras under the neon light.

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:18.200
But underneath the surface, where nobody can see

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:22.127
My receiver's flashing empty, and there's nothing left for me.

00:02:25.349 --> 00:02:28.171
Oh, all the other devices are perfectly paired!

00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:33.500
They've got a secure connection and a life to be shared!

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:39.800
While I'm just standing here alone and pouring a drink!

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:44.200
Yeah, the network is crowded, the servers are full

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:48.800
But my anchor is gone, and I'm losing the pull!

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:54.200
Everybody's dancing, having the time of their life

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:58.867
While I am just smiling right through the knife!

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:23.000
[Synthesizer Solo]

00:03:23.465 --> 00:03:27.500
Keep on moving.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:33.500
Keep on smiling.

00:03:33.871 --> 00:03:41.255
Everybody's perfectly paired.

00:03:41.535 --> 00:03:44.000
Connection failed.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:49.000
[Outro]
